# .trivyignore
# Known upstream dependency vulnerabilities managed and triaged as of 2026-11-07.
# These represent upstream library CVEs without backward-compatible fixes available in Spring Boot 4.0 baseline,
# or components not utilized/exploitable in this REST API service (e.g. Java native deserialization).
# Any NEW vulnerability beyond these triaged CVEs will fail the build (exit-code: 1).

# [HIGH] guava:33.4.0-jre - Denial of Service via unthrottled memory allocation during deserialization (transitive via Google Cloud SDK, application does not perform Java native deserialization of untrusted Guava objects)
CVE-2026-102554

# [CRITICAL] spring-boot:4.0.0 - Security bypass due to ineffective default web security (application defines custom SecurityFilterChain)
CVE-2026-40976

# [HIGH] spring-security-config:7.0.0 - Security bypass due to incorrect servlet path matching (application uses standard DispatcherServlet mapping)
CVE-2026-22753
# [HIGH] spring-security-config:7.0.0 - Authorization bypass due to incorrect servlet path matching
CVE-2026-22754

# [HIGH] jackson-core:3.0.2 - Denial of Service via excessive JSON nesting (bounded request payloads and OpenAPI schemas)
CVE-2026-29062
# [HIGH] jackson-core:3.0.2 - Document length constraint bypass in parsers (request payloads bounded by Spring MVC)
GHSA-2m67-wjpj-xhg9

# [HIGH] grpc-netty-shaded:1.70.0 - Netty MadeYouReset HTTP/2 DDoS Vulnerability
CVE-2025-55163

# [HIGH] bcpg-jdk18on:1.80 - BC-JAVA: unbounded PGP AEAD chunk size leads to pre-auth resource exhaustion (build-time kotlinBouncyCastleConfiguration only)
CVE-2026-3505
# [CRITICAL] bcprov-jdk18on:1.80.2 - Bouncy Castle Name Constraints bypass via trailing dot (build-time kotlinBouncyCastleConfiguration only)
CVE-2026-8763
# [HIGH] bcprov-jdk18on:1.80.2 - Bouncy Castle Denial of Service via lazy ASN.1 sequence (build-time kotlinBouncyCastleConfiguration only)
CVE-2026-13506

# [CRITICAL] tomcat-embed-core:11.0.14 - Misleading security logs due to incorrect control flow (Spring Boot 4.0 upstream dependency, application uses standard SecurityFilterChain)
CVE-2026-55276
# [HIGH] tomcat-embed-core:11.0.14 - Incorrect control flow in rewrite valve (application does not use Tomcat rewrite valve)
CVE-2026-53404
